id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18873::$$$message_0104_0000_0000$$$::"Onsen?"::
18874::$$$message_0104_0000_0001$$$::"A local term for baths fed from natural hot springs, Mistress, over 25 degrees Celsius or containing particular minerals in the water."::
18875::$$$message_0104_0000_0002$$$::"Huh. Why are you bringing it up, though?"::
18876::$$$message_0104_0000_0003$$$::"Sella, chilly. Onsen, warm up. Maybe."::
18877::$$$message_0104_0000_0004$$$::"Never mind me. [wait canskip=0 time=600][hffacechg chara=セラ face=楽 layer=1 time=200][l][say storage=HIRI1_SER_0030 _name=セラ]This letter came for you."::
18878::$$$message_0104_0000_0005$$$::"If you read it already, just tell me what it says. If it isn't interesting, go ahead and dispose of it."::
18879::$$$message_0104_0000_0006$$$::"Yes, Mistress. In summary, the first Master to arrive at the hot spring resort listed here will receive a ticket for a free stay."::
18880::$$$message_0104_0000_0007$$$::"From whom?"::
18881::$$$message_0104_0000_0008$$$::"Kirei Kotomine, the Holy Grail War Overseer."::
18882::$$$message_0104_0001_0000$$$::"It is a chance to take respite, and it says that the King of Heroes just happened to win the ticket in a lottery..."::
18883::$$$message_0104_0001_0001$$$::"Hmm... [hffacechg chara=イリヤ face=喜 layer=0 time=200][l][say storage=HIRI1_IRI_0060 _name=イリヤ]That could be interesting if the other Masters show up. I'll go kill some time there."::
18884::$$$message_0104_0001_0002$$$::"Have fun."::
18885::$$$message_0104_0001_0003$$$::"I will. Let's go, Berserker!"::
18886::$$$message_0104_0001_0004$$$::"[wacky len=5][line len=3]!!!"::Ba